<title>USA: AirNet shares reach 52-week high.</title>
<headline>AirNet shares reach 52-week high.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>AirNet Systems Inc shares gained 2-1/4 points to reach a 52-week high, closing at 23, after it announced an agreement to acquire Data Air Courier Inc.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement about the increase in its stock price that it knows of no other corporate developments, other than its public announcements, that would account for the market activity.</p>
<p>AirNet said earlier today that it would acquire Data Air Courier, transporter of canceled checks, for $4 million.</p>
